      "factor_coverage": 0.9309,
      "rank_turnover": null,
      "decay_5d_ic": null,
      "decay_10d_ic": null,
      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "Daily cross-sectional rank IC is positive in all tested broad regimes: 2020-2022 +0.018294 (712 dates), 2023-2024 +0.003543 (516), 2025-2026 +0.012434 (516), and 2027-2028 +0.012644 (448). Interpret uncertainty conservatively due to the 15-asset cross-section.",
